59
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,560
Estaremos en casa

60
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:34,359
esperándote.

61
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:34,840
Sí,

62
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,840
esperándote.

63
